<title>USA: &quot;Green shoe&quot; shares Intellicell exercised.</title>
<headline>&quot;Green shoe&quot; shares Intellicell exercised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A &quot;green shoe&quot; representing 300,000 shares of Intellicell Corp was exercised, underwriter Sands Brothers &amp; Co Ltd said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Under a &quot;green shoe&quot;, additional shares may be allocated to investors if demand is heavy.</p>
<p>In December 1996, Intellicell's two million share initial public offering was priced at $5 per share of common stock.</p>
<p>Intellicell, a Van Nuys, Calif.-based distributor of wireless communications products said it plans to use the net proceeds from the offering to fund proposed expansion, repay debt and for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
